   The place where I found the latest version of nethack for the PC,
V3.0 pl7, was by anonymous ftp to:

     linc.cis.upenn.edu

in the directory:

     pub/NH3.0/PC/(disk1 & disk2)

In theses two directories you will find the distribution of Nethack as
you would if you had gotten it on floppy from the distributors. Also
when you get the files be sure to get them in binary mode.

I also solved the problem I was having with Nethack accessing my
hard drive by going from pl6 to pl7.

If I can be of any further assistance contact me directly. I have assumed that
you are familiar with the anonymous ftp stuff and downloading files in
this manner if not let me know and I would be happy to give you a more
complete explanation.


